  "question": {
    "text": "A long straight wire of radius a carries a steady current I. The current is uniformly distributed across its cross section. The ratio of the magnetic field at $\\frac{a}{2}$ and $2 a$ from axis of the wire is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
